* TAOCP 1.3.2 ex 10, finds a saddle point in a 9x8 matrix
*
MATRIX	EQU	1009		The first element of the matrix
	ORIG	0
MINROW	ORIG	*+18		gets the min address in the row
MAXCOL	ORIG	*+0		gets the max address in the column FIXME: the number of memory addresses
**********
**********
* implement MINROW
* rI2 will hold the min address and should be initialized with the first memory address of the row
* rI3 will be used to store the min value
* rI4 will be used to count comparisons
* rI5 will be used to store the next address
	ORIG	MINROW
	STJ	0F
* initialize
FIRSTA	ST2	*
TEMP	NOP
	LD3	0,2
	ENT4	8
NEXTMIN	DEC4	1
* checked all values?
	J4Z	0F
* is current min greater than the next value?
	ST4	TEMP
	LDA	FIRSTA
	ADD	TEMP
	STA	TEMP
	LD5	TEMP
	CMP3	0,5
	JLE	NEXTMIN
* swap for new min
	LD2	TEMP
	LD3	0,2
	JMP	NEXTMIN
* found the min
0H	JMP	*-*
	END	MINROW
